atient Examination Pro", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pre-Configured Scenarios:\n\nVarious clinical cases covering common and rare conditions.\nScenarios range in complexity to suit different expertise levels, from medical students to seasoned professionals.\n\nPatient Interaction:\n\nVirtual patients with realistic symptoms, behaviors, and histories.\nDynamic responses to user actions, such as questions during history-taking or physical examination maneuvers.\n\nExamination Tools:\n\nVirtual stethoscopes, and other diagnostic tools to simulate physical exams.\nIntegration of digital pathology tools, allowing for skin examinations, and more.\n\nLab Analysis and Imaging:\n\nAccess to virtual lab results (e.g., CBC, LFT, urinalysis).\nSimulated radiology imaging tools (e.g., X-rays, CT scans, MRI) with real-time interpretation options.\n\nReal-Time Feedback and Evaluation:\n\nAutomated feedback on diagnosis and decision-making.\n\nCustomization:\n\nLooking for more - contact us with your curriculum requirements!", "short_description": "The platform provides immersive, pre-configured clinical scenarios where learners interact with virtual patients to practice history-taking, physical exams, lab analysis, and imaging interpretation. Using realistic tools and dynamic feedback, users develop diagnostic and decision-making skills while educators can customize cases and track performance. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://provenreality.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Proven reality", "support_website_url": "https://provenreality.com/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://provenreality.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQU